/P 287 0 R
/E (The same EOG classes were connected to a real-time cursor-control program. Up and Down predictions produced vertical movement, and two detected blinks within 700 ms produced a mouse click. Confidence filtering, short-term voting, and an action cooldown were used to reduce unstable commands.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
